@dpsBase = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@authToken = user_token_123

### Progreso de extracción del grafo para un documento (por documento)
GET {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/progress/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Re-extraer el grafo para un documento (aditivo, MERGE)
POST {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/reextract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "selector": { "document_ids": [1] },
  "force": false
}


### Re-extraer el grafo para varios documentos
POST {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/reextract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "selector": { "document_ids": [1, 2, 3] },
  "force": false
}


### Re-extraer el grafo para TODA la base (de a poco)
POST {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/reextract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "selector": { "all_documents": true },
  "force": true
}


### Estado del job masivo de extracción del grafo
GET {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/batch-status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Detener el job masivo en curso
DELETE {{dpsBase}}/graph/extraction/stop
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
